nfusion, it can simply update the procedure texts, e.g., “it may include the DL Forwarding UP TNL Information IE in the Handover Request Acknowledge Transfer IE as forwarding tunnel for the QoS flows listed in the QoS Flow Setup Response List IE of the HANDOVER REQUEST ACKNOWLEDGE message. ZTE | Based on our answers in previous two questions, we prefer to support option 1. Deutsche Telekom | From explanations we would expect Option 1.

